{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24738","headline":"听芦管 · 白居易","name":"听芦管","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽咽新芦管，凄凉古竹枝。\n似临猨峡唱，疑在雁门吹。\n调爲高多切，声缘小乍迟。\n麤豪嫌觱篥，细妙胜参差。\n云水巴南客，风沙陇上儿。\n屈原收泪夜，苏武断肠时。\n仰秣胡驹听，惊栖越鸟知。\n何言胡越异，闻此一同悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}